      "writtenOn": "2016-01-19T21:46:35Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Looking at base_url method [1], this is going to be:\n\n    endpoint + \"/v3/implied_roles/\" + ref[\u0027prior_role_id\u0027]\n\nWhich doesn\u0027t point to a valid implied role. Theses links are intended to be valid so that a client may use it.\n\n[1] https://github.com/openstack/keystone/blob/bc483fd/keystone/common/controller.py#L417-L423",
      "revId": "ae741f4dcd124e1380190b0a6ad4cfd476506c3e",
